-- Adds Demontez's full schedule (from the DaySilk Full Schedule PDF, Nov 5 2026) to his DaySilk in the Maison de Veux portal.
-- Run once in the MAISON DE VEUX Supabase project (SQL Editor). Nothing to paste or edit.
-- It MERGES into what is already there: habits, goals, tasks and events you already have are left alone (matched by text);
-- the old "New York market day" template is replaced by the full set below. Safe to run twice.
--
-- Adds: 10 day templates (Atlanta Mon to Sun, Market day, Market weekend, Travel day), the weekly pattern,
